 "notes": "Temperature and humidity from MQTT (home/temp, home/humidity). Page 'now' shows numbers, page 'trend' a 2 h temperature history (120 rows x 60 s). A full-screen modal opens when temperature > 28 and closes itself when it is back at or below 28."
}